# Skill reads

When you read a `SKILL.md` file, print one line in the reply:
`Used <folder-name>`
`<folder-name>` is the directory that contains that file.
Print the line once for that file, then follow the skill.
Do not describe the file in place of that line.

Reading `.cursor/skills/implement/SKILL.md` prints `Used implement`.
